- {{ill|Kashima Jingu|ja|鹿島神宮|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kashima-jingū|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 鹿島神宮}} (鹿嶋神宮) in [[:en:Hitachi Province|Hitachi Province]]: Served from ancient times, involved in divination.

- {{ill|Katsuragi Hitotoshi Shrine|ja|葛城一言主神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Katsuragi Hitotoshi Shrine|qq=}} (葛城一言主神社) in [[:en:Yamato Province|Yamato Province]]: Ancestor served as a priest.

- [[:en:Munakata Taisha|Munakata Taisha]] (宗像大社) in [[:en:Chikuzen Province|Chikuzen Province]]: Ancestors served, later becoming vassals of the [[:en:Kuroda clan|Kuroda clan]] (黒田氏).
